## Recommended Python packages

| Package | Use | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `yfinance` | Free Yahoo Finance prices/fundamentals | Scrapes; no auth; rate-limit gently |
| `pandas` | OHLCV frames | Almost always already a transitive dep |
| `numpy` | Vectorized math for indicators | Same |
| `polygon-api-client` | Paid: stocks, options, forex, crypto | Needs `POLYGON_API_KEY` |
| `alpaca-py` | Alpaca brokerage data + paper trading | Needs `ALPACA_KEY` / `ALPACA_SECRET` |
| `ib_insync` | Interactive Brokers | Local TWS / IB Gateway required |
| `ccxt` | Crypto exchanges (Binance/Coinbase/etc) | Needs per-exchange keys |
| `alpha_vantage` | Free tier for daily/weekly | Free tier rate-limited |

**Default for v0.1:** `yfinance` — no auth, free, sufficient for personal portfolio analysis.

